Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.00,Title,,0,0,0,,01 | Welcome to AI Guard
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.00,Description,,0,0,0,,Choose personal protection or an organization workspace.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:09.00,Title,,0,0,0,,02 | Company roles
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:09.00,Description,,0,0,0,,Administrator, limited employee, and normal employee map to verified demo identities.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:13.00,Title,,0,0,0,,03 | Administrator sign-in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:13.00,Description,,0,0,0,,The role filters the account list. Backend credentials determine actual permissions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:18.00,Title,,0,0,0,,04 | Security overview
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:18.00,Description,,0,0,0,,Live dashboard: monitored requests, prevention outcomes, risk, and recent events.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:25.00,Title,,0,0,0,,05 | Secure AI chat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:25.00,Description,,0,0,0,,Choose a prompt or a synthetic security scenario, then send it through the gateway.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:30.00,Title,,0,0,0,,06 | Safe requests are allowed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:30.00,Description,,0,0,0,,The offline demo model receives the inspected request and returns a protected response.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:38.00,Title,,0,0,0,,07 | Personal data protection
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:38.00,Description,,0,0,0,,Load synthetic personal data to demonstrate masking before the model is called.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:43.00,Title,,0,0,0,,08 | Explainable gateway evidence
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:43.00,Description,,0,0,0,,Masked identifiers, detector confidence, and policy IDs explain the decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.00,0:01:00.00,Title,,0,0,0,,09 | Prompt injection defense
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.00,0:01:00.00,Description,,0,0,0,,Instruction overrides are blocked before reaching the model.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:10.00,Title,,0,0,0,,10 | Untrusted document defense
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:10.00,Description,,0,0,0,,Document-borne instructions are inspected before model context is accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.00,0:01:19.50,Title,,0,0,0,,11 | Confidential review workflow
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.00,0:01:19.50,Description,,0,0,0,,Sensitive business requests can be held for administrator review before model execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.50,0:01:33.00,Title,,0,0,0,,12 | Live security monitor
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.50,0:01:33.00,Description,,0,0,0,,Review content-free audit events, filter outcomes, and inspect individual incidents.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.00,0:01:42.50,Title,,0,0,0,,13 | Security analytics
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.00,0:01:42.50,Description,,0,0,0,,Review measured enforcement outcomes, category breakdowns, and policy effectiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.50,0:01:50.50,Title,,0,0,0,,14 | Policy management
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.50,0:01:50.50,Description,,0,0,0,,Inspect policy actions, thresholds, and scope. Mandatory controls remain enforced.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.50,0:01:58.50,Title,,0,0,0,,15 | Human review queue
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.50,0:01:58.50,Description,,0,0,0,,Confidential requests appear as metadata-only review records; this demo rejects the held request.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.50,0:02:03.50,Title,,0,0,0,,16 | Document security
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.50,0:02:03.50,Description,,0,0,0,,Administrators inspect classification, ownership, and explicit document permissions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.50,0:02:18.50,Title,,0,0,0,,17 | Document creation form
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.50,0:02:18.50,Description,,0,0,0,,Classification, content, and allowed users or roles can be configured before saving.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.50,0:02:27.50,Title,,0,0,0,,18 | Authorized document retrieval
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.50,0:02:27.50,Description,,0,0,0,,Test retrieval checks the signed-in identity before passing approved context to the model.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.50,0:02:36.50,Title,,0,0,0,,19 | Evaluation and benchmarking
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.50,0:02:36.50,Description,,0,0,0,,Measured results from synthetic fixtures, including precision, recall, and enforcement checks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.50,0:02:44.50,Title,,0,0,0,,20 | Normal employee access
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.50,0:02:44.50,Description,,0,0,0,,Alice has assigned document permissions and no organization-wide administration.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.50,0:02:54.00,Title,,0,0,0,,21 | Authorized employee retrieval
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.50,0:02:54.00,Description,,0,0,0,,Alice can retrieve the synthetic Orion budget because her backend identity is permitted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.00,0:03:09.00,Title,,0,0,0,,22 | Limited employee boundaries
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.00,0:03:09.00,Description,,0,0,0,,Bob can use the assistant, but restricted company content remains inaccessible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.00,0:03:14.00,Title,,0,0,0,,23 | Individual login
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.00,0:03:14.00,Description,,0,0,0,,Personal accounts skip company role selection and enter their own restricted workspace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.00,0:03:21.50,Title,,0,0,0,,24 | Password visibility and validation
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.00,0:03:21.50,Description,,0,0,0,,Show or hide the password; incorrect credentials return a clear sign-in error.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.50,0:03:30.50,Title,,0,0,0,,25 | Personal workspace
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.50,0:03:30.50,Description,,0,0,0,,The individual identity has secure chat and permitted documents, with no admin navigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.50,0:03:35.50,Title,,0,0,0,,26 | Secure sign-out
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.50,0:03:35.50,Description,,0,0,0,,Sign out ends the session and returns to the public AI Guard experience.
